# Cline rules for Subscription Guard

Read AGENTS.md fully before starting any task in this repo — it has the
non-negotiable safety rules (human-in-the-loop cancellation, RLS on every
user table, no service-role key in the repo, no scope creep into deferred
features) and the stack conventions already established.

Read NEXT_STEPS.md next for the ordered backlog. Work top to bottom, one
unchecked item at a time. Read docs/PRODUCT_DOSSIER.md for full product
context whenever a task references product behavior not fully specified in
AGENTS.md or NEXT_STEPS.md.

After completing each NEXT_STEPS.md item:
1. Run `npx tsc --noEmit` — must be clean.
2. Run `npm run build` — must be clean.
3. Check the item off in NEXT_STEPS.md.
4. Summarize the change before starting the next item — don't silently chain
   multiple backlog items into one uninterrupted run.

If a task would touch anything in AGENTS.md's "Non-negotiable rules" list
(automated merchant contact, storing the service-role key, adding a feature
marked deferred), stop and ask the human instead of proceeding.
